===Unveil the hidden memories and discover the Demiurge's past{{subst:void|<!--104370401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=<!--to be added-->|Let me tell you the story of "Membrance Maze": A group of cute little friends live in Aedes Elysiae's forests. Their names can be connected into a song...<br />One, two, three, four, five, six, seven ♪<br />Do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, ti ♪<br />Tiny seeds of life sprout within pristine memories. In the most tender corners of the heart, that genuine shiver stirred by lament... That's the "mover of life."}}
